    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Pumwani Maternity Hospital has a long history of providing maternity and newborn care to the women of Nairobi and is an important resource for the community.  The Aga Khan University (AKU) has advised and assisted several public hospitals, including Pumwani  Maternity Hospital, by providing assistance in areas such as education, training and research. This is an important part of AKU's permanent mission to Kenya and East Africa.",
